<title>UK: IBRD adds $20 million to Nov 1999 step-up bond.</title>
<headline>IBRD adds $20 million to Nov 1999 step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond increase was announced by lead manager Sanwa.</p>
<p>BORROWER  INTERNATIONAL BANK FOR RECONSTRUCTION AND DEVELOPMENT</p>
<p> AMT   *$120 MLN	COUPON    *6.0	 MATURITY    18.NOV.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.10    PAY DATE    27.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  10 BP     LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K)  1-10</p>
<p>SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  5 BP	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	TO 18.NOV.97 THEN 6.5 PCT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>		 CALLABLE AT PAR ON 18.NOV.97 ONLY.</p>
<p>		FUNGIBLE WITH EXISTING $100 MILLION LAUNCHED ON</p>
<p>		 17.OCT.96.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
